# ---- PII guard — this repo publishes to GitHub Pages ------------------
# The radar repos bake ui/data.js (40 demo pins) for publication here.
# The full pool / call sheet CSVs carry real phones, emails and NPNs and
# must NEVER land in this repo. CSVs are blanket-banned; force-add (-f)
# only something verified PII-free.
*.csv
full_pool*
call_sheet*
data/raw/
data/state/
*.part

__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
.DS_Store
